---
// ConversationStrip — three panels showing real Claude Code dialogue:
//  1. Cold start: agent loads identity before responding
//  2. Mid-session capture offer (the agent proposes, user confirms)
//  3. /thinkos-morning output
//
// Static, monospace, CSS-only. No fabricated quotes — every line mirrors
// behavior described in the first-action protocol and shipped slash commands.
---
<section class="border-t border-rule">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-6 md:px-10 py-24 md:py-32">

    <header class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-6 mb-12 reveal">
      <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-3">
        <p class="kicker">In a session</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-8 md:col-start-5">
        <h2 class="display text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-5">What it looks like.</h2>
        <p class="text-[17px] md:text-[18px] leading-relaxed text-muted max-w-[60ch]">
          Three moments from a real workday. Cold start in a new terminal,
          a capture mid-flow, and the morning brief. Every line below mirrors
          the shipped first-action protocol — nothing simulated.
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-px bg-rule border border-rule reveal">

      <!-- PANEL 1 — cold start -->
      <article class="bg-paper p-6 md:p-7 flex flex-col hover-card">
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between border-b border-rule pb-3 mb-4">
          <p class="kicker">01 · Cold start</p>
          <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-muted">~2s</p>
        </div>
        <pre class="font-mono text-[12px] md:text-[12.5px] leading-[1.65] text-ink whitespace-pre-wrap break-words m-0 flex-1">
<span class="text-muted">$</span> <span class="text-accent">claude</span>

<span class="text-muted">&gt;</span> who am i, and what am i on this week?

<span class="text-muted">// reading vault before responding</span>
<span class="text-muted">mcp__basic-memory__search_notes("identity")</span>
<span class="text-muted">mcp__basic-memory__read_note("Current Focus")</span>

You're Sam — Engineering Lead at Cardinal
Studio, Brooklyn. Backend focus, six years
across distributed systems. You write
terse and push back on hedging.

This week's focus (covers_week 2026-W20):

  · ship the v2 ingestion pipeline
  · draft Q3 hiring plan (Friday)
  · clear two stuck PR reviews

Two stale notes flagged — run /thinkos-vitals
when you have a sec.</pre>
      </article>

      <!-- PANEL 2 — capture offer mid-session -->
      <article class="bg-paper p-6 md:p-7 flex flex-col hover-card">
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between border-b border-rule pb-3 mb-4">
          <p class="kicker">02 · Capture, mid-flow</p>
          <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-muted">~30s</p>
        </div>
        <pre class="font-mono text-[12px] md:text-[12.5px] leading-[1.65] text-ink whitespace-pre-wrap break-words m-0 flex-1">
<span class="text-muted">&gt;</span> from now on, capture decisions go in
<span class="text-muted">&gt;</span> the personal hub, never the project
<span class="text-muted">&gt;</span> vault. project vault is for team
<span class="text-muted">&gt;</span> activity only.

Got it. That sounds like a standing
decision — worth logging in
04 Knowledge/Decisions.md so it
survives this session?

  Tags I'd suggest:
    [capture] [privacy] [vault-routing]

<span class="text-muted">&gt;</span> yes

<span class="text-muted">// writing</span>
<span class="text-muted">mcp__basic-memory__edit_note(</span>
<span class="text-muted">  "Decisions", operation="append"</span>
<span class="text-muted">)</span>

Logged. /thinkos-decisions will surface
it; /thinkos-undo-capture if you want
it gone.</pre>
      </article>

      <!-- PANEL 3 — /thinkos-morning -->
      <article class="bg-paper p-6 md:p-7 flex flex-col hover-card">
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between border-b border-rule pb-3 mb-4">
          <p class="kicker">03 · /thinkos-morning</p>
          <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-muted">~3s</p>
        </div>
        <pre class="font-mono text-[12px] md:text-[12.5px] leading-[1.65] text-ink whitespace-pre-wrap break-words m-0 flex-1">
<span class="text-muted">&gt;</span> /thinkos-morning

<span class="text-accent">Tuesday, May 19 — quiet week, no client cuts.</span>

This week (top 3):
  1. v2 ingestion pipeline — cut release
  2. Q3 hiring plan, first draft Friday
  3. clear PR queue (T. + R.)

On your plate today:
  · v2 release notes
  · 1:1 with Priya, 2pm
  · review J.'s API proposal

Awaiting your reply:
  · Marcus — infra budget (3d)
  · L. Wong — Granola plugin spec

Calendar: 2 meetings, both afternoon.
No fresh sync overnight — Mac was asleep.</pre>
      </article>

    </div>

    <p class="mt-8 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-muted">
      Sample vault content. Sam Reyes and Cardinal Studio are fictional — your real vault has your real notes.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>
